    "starterCode": "def detect_box_plot_outliers(values):\n    # Return list of outlier values\n    pass",
    "expectedOutput": "detect_box_plot_outliers([10, 12, 11, 13, 100]) == [100]",
    "solution": "def detect_box_plot_outliers(values):\n    s = sorted(values)\n    n = len(s)\n    q1 = s[int(0.25 * n)]\n    q3 = s[int(0.75 * n)]\n    iqr = q3 - q1\n    lower = q1 - 1.5 * iqr\n    upper = q3 + 1.5 * iqr\n    return [x for x in values if x < lower or x > upper]",
