    "solution": "def find_highly_correlated_pairs(corr_matrix, threshold=0.8):\n    pairs = []\n    cols = sorted(corr_matrix.keys())\n    for i in range(len(cols)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(cols)):\n            c1, c2 = cols[i], cols[j]\n            if abs(corr_matrix[c1].get(c2, 0)) >= threshold:\n                pairs.append((c1, c2))\n    return pairs",
