    "starterCode": "def compute_tpr_fpr(y_true, y_scores, threshold):\n    # Return (tpr, fpr)\n    pass",
    "expectedOutput": "compute_tpr_fpr([1, 0], [0.9, 0.1], 0.5) == (1.0, 0.0)",
    "solution": "def compute_tpr_fpr(y_true, y_scores, threshold):\n    preds = [1 if s >= threshold else 0 for s in y_scores]\n    tp = sum(1 for yt, yp in zip(y_true, preds) if yt == 1 and yp == 1)\n    fp = sum(1 for yt, yp in zip(y_true, preds) if yt == 0 and yp == 1)\n    fn = sum(1 for yt, yp in zip(y_true, preds) if yt == 1 and yp == 0)\n    tn = sum(1 for yt, yp in zip(y_true, preds) if yt == 0 and yp == 0)\n    tpr = tp / (tp + fn) if (tp + fn) > 0 else 0.0\n    fpr = fp / (fp + tn) if (fp + tn) > 0 else 0.0\n    return (tpr, fpr)",
