    "solution": "def trapezoidal_auc(fpr_list, tpr_list):\n    points = sorted(zip(fpr_list, tpr_list), key=lambda p: p[0])\n    area = 0.0\n    for i in range(len(points) - 1):\n        x1, y1 = points[i]\n        x2, y2 = points[i + 1]\n        area += (x2 - x1) * (y1 + y2) / 2.0\n    return area",
