    "starterCode": "def format_bubble_sizes(values, max_bubble_size=50):\n    # Return scaled size list\n    pass",
    "expectedOutput": "format_bubble_sizes([0, 100], 50) == [5.0, 50.0]",
    "solution": "def format_bubble_sizes(values, max_bubble_size=50):\n    min_v, max_v = min(values), max(values)\n    if min_v == max_v: return [25.0] * len(values)\n    return [5.0 + (x - min_v) / (max_v - min_v) * (max_bubble_size - 5.0) for x in values]",
