    "expectedOutput": "find_top_correlated_feature([1, 2, 3], {'f1': [1, 2, 3], 'f2': [1, 0, 1]}) == 'f1'",
    "solution": "def find_top_correlated_feature(target_y, features_dict):\n    def corr(a, b):\n        n = len(a)\n        ma, mb = sum(a) / n, sum(b) / n\n        cov = sum((x - ma) * (y - mb) for x, y in zip(a, b))\n        va = sum((x - ma) ** 2 for x in a)\n        vb = sum((y - mb) ** 2 for y in b)\n        return abs(cov / ((va * vb) ** 0.5)) if va * vb > 0 else 0.0\n    return max(features_dict.keys(), key=lambda k: corr(target_y, features_dict[k]))",
