    "starterCode": "def exponential_moving_average(series, alpha=0.5):\n    # Return EMA list\n    pass",
    "expectedOutput": "exponential_moving_average([10, 20], 0.5) == [10.0, 15.0]",
    "solution": "def exponential_moving_average(series, alpha=0.5):\n    if not series: return []\n    ema = [float(series[0])]\n    for x in series[1:]:\n        ema.append(alpha * x + (1.0 - alpha) * ema[-1])\n    return ema",
