    "question": "Write a JavaScript function `detectMetadataQuery(url)` that returns true if a given URL attempts to access the AWS EC2 instance metadata IP address (`169.254.169.254` or `metadata.google.internal`).",
    "starterCode": "function detectMetadataQuery(url) {\n  // your code here\n}",
