    "expectedOutput": "True",
    "solution": "def detect_circular_loop(action_history: list[str], window_size: int = 3) -> bool:\n    if len(action_history) < 2 * window_size:\n        return False\n    latest_window = action_history[-window_size:]\n    preceding_window = action_history[-2 * window_size : -window_size]\n    return latest_window == preceding_window",
    "explanation": "Detects repetitive circular loops in agent actions to prompt backtracking or termination."
